  "story": {
    "day": 97,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Friday",
    "sentences": [
      "It was Friday, the twelfth of March.",
      "Kaya had to finish many things for her parent by the weekend.",
      "Her parent would often tell Kaya to always be ready for April.",
      "She would get to the house, ordering brown chocolate by phone.",
      "Later, Kaya walked to the pharmacy for olive oil and an egg.",
      "She saw an interesting toy panda and a small rabbit there.",
      "Kaya had an interview next Thursday about the U.S.",
      "It was about a religious place, like a garden tree.",
      "She planned to bring her dictionary, purple T-shirt, and umbrella.",
      "A bed, near a cat on its seat, held her things.",
      "Kaya imagined a big yacht and a little boat near a pool.",
      "\"Uh-huh, I cannot worry,\" she thought. \"I am sure to be careful!\""
    ]
  }
}